        },
        "question_Lycgkq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What is Design ROI?",
            "content": "<p>Design ROI refers to the measurable return on investment businesses gain from professional design services. Whether it’s improving productivity, increasing customer satisfaction, or driving revenue growth, a well-designed space delivers tangible benefits beyond aesthetics. Research shows that every £100 spent on design by a design-led business can increase turnover by £225.</p>",
            "show_icon": true,
            "icon_name": "icon-info-empty",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#ab8c52"
          }
        },
        "question_WUfJfq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Is interior design worth the investment?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely. Professional interior design is a strategic investment that delivers long-term benefits. It enhances your brand perception, increases customer retention, and boosts employee performance, ultimately driving higher revenue and market share. Businesses that prioritize design are three times more likely to experience rapid growth and innovation compared to those that don’t.</p>",
            "show_icon": true,
            "icon_name": "icon-info-empty",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#ab8c52"
          }
        },
        "question_gy9wg9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Can design really increase my revenue?",
            "content": "<p>es, it can. Research from the Design Council reveals that businesses that invest in design increase their turnover and market share significantly. Design-led companies outperform the stock market by 200%, and businesses that embrace design see an average 6.3% market share increase. These numbers show how impactful design can be on your bottom line.</p>",
            "show_icon": true,
            "icon_name": "icon-info-empty",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#ab8c52"
          }
        },
        "question_efcDUU": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Why should I hire a professional?",
            "content": "<p>Professional designers bring expertise, creativity, and experience to the table, ensuring your space is functional, visually stunning, and aligned with your business goals. They understand how to maximize budgets, source quality materials, and create spaces that deliver measurable results like increased productivity or revenue. Doing it yourself might save money initially, but it’s unlikely to achieve the same level of impact or ROI.</p>",
            "show_icon": true,
            "icon_name": "icon-info-empty",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#ab8c52"
          }
        },
        "question_X9CKUF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "How can I measure the ROI of interior design in my business?",
            "content": "<p>Design ROI can be measured in several ways, including increased revenue, customer retention, employee productivity, and brand perception. For example, tracking sales before and after a retail redesign, or measuring employee satisfaction and productivity in a new office layout, can provide concrete data on the impact of design.</p>",
            "show_icon": true,
            "icon_name": "icon-info-empty",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#ab8c52"
          }
        }
